        Command ``autopilot.broll`` (needs EditSequence; runs an AI model, so MediaAnalysis is needed too).
        Returns the Result of the edit (``.data`` holds the command's own answer).

        Args:
            _params: The parameters as one dict instead of keywords (a keyword wins); for a name that
                cannot be a keyword.
            gapSeconds: Seconds between two B-roll clips at least (default 4).
            introSeconds: No B-roll over the first seconds (default 3).
            maxSeconds: The longest B-roll clip, in seconds (default 6).
            minScore: How well a match must fit, 0..1 (default 0.35).
            minSeconds: The shortest B-roll clip, in seconds (default 2).
            perMinute: At most this many B-roll clips per minute (default 4).
            placements: Place exactly these (the preview's chosen suggestions) instead of searching.
            sequence: The sequence; only needed when the project has several.
            visual: Match by picture too when the visual search model is installed (default true). (Default: True.)
