            referenceCuts: Or the reference's cuts, in seconds.
            referenceLength: With referenceCuts: the reference's length in seconds.
            sequence: The sequence; only needed when the project has several.
            strength: 1 = the reference's shot lengths (default); 0.5 = halfway between the sequence's and the reference's.
            tolerance: A shot longer than this times the target gets cuts (default 1.35).
