            clicks: Zoom on clicks (default true). (Default: True.)
            cursor: A cursor sidecar's content: Wabcut JSON ({"format": "wabcut.cursor", ...}) or CSV t,x,y[,event].
            detect: Where activity comes from: a cursor sidecar if there is one, else the frames (default); only a sidecar; only the frames.
            dwell: Zoom where the cursor comes to rest (default true). (Default: True.)
            easing: Key interpolation: ease in and out (default), linear, or the smooth optimised path.
            fps: Frames analysed per second when detecting (default 10).
            hold: Seconds to stay zoomed after the last click or keystroke there (default 1.5).
