            maxZoom: Largest zoom, 1.1..4 (default 2).
            preview: Also return the window over time and the activity, for drawing (default false). (Default: False.)
            sequence: Sequence id; only needed when the project has several.
            sidecar: A cursor sidecar file (only where the host allows reading files).
            smoothness: Camera smoothness, 0 (follows closely) .. 1 (moves only when it must); default 0.5.
            transition: Shortest zoom in / out / pan, in seconds (default 0.6).
            typing: Zoom on typing (default true). (Default: True.)
            dryRun: Preview the edit without committing it.
            expectedRevision: Fail with StaleRevision unless the project is at this revision.
            idempotencyKey: A repeated call with the same key returns the first result.
        """


