        Args:
            _params: The parameters as one dict instead of keywords (a keyword wins); for a name that
                cannot be a keyword.
            audioRoles: What each audio stream of the recordings carries, by stream (OBS track 1, 2, ...): "auto" keeps the stream's own role. Default: with several streams, a stream titled like OBS's Mic/Aux is the mic, Game/Desktop Audio and Alerts are game, Discord and Music are left out; streams without such a title: the most voice-like is the mic (unless a title named it), the others game. A single stream is mixed.
            chatDelay: How late chat reacts, seconds (default 6).
            chatOffset: Chat time + this = recording time, seconds (default: as imported).
            count: How many moments at most. Default 10.
            keywords: Words and emotes that count as reactions, besides the usual ones.
            markers: Mark the moments. Default true. (Default: True.)
