            previewFormat: Preview file format id ("" = default; "prores", "dnxhr", "h264").
            rippleMarkers: Markers > Ripple Sequence Markers: sequence markers move with insert, extract, ripple delete and ripple trims.
            rippleTrackKeyframes: Sequence > Ripple Track Keyframes: the keyframes of the tracks and the master bus move with the same ripple edits. Default off.
            sequence: Sequence id; only needed when the project has several.
            startTimecode: Start time: the timecode of the first frame ("01:00:00:00") or ticks.
