        Args:
            _params: The parameters as one dict instead of keywords (a keyword wins); for a name that
                cannot be a keyword.
            first: First word index.
            from_: Only words that end after this time. Timecode in the sequence's rate ("00:01:02:03") or ticks.
            last: Last word index.
